            <title>[IGNITE-5390] Bug in IgniteCacheTxStoreSessionWriteBehindCoalescingTest</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-5390</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;IgniteCacheTxStoreSessionWriteBehindCoalescingTest override cacheConfiguration method from IgniteCacheStoreSessionWriteBehindAbstractTest to switch TestStore into TestNonCoalescingStore.&lt;br/&gt;
But IgniteCacheStoreSessionWriteBehindAbstractTest.getConfiguration cacheStoreFactory explicitly set to TestStore for ccfg1.&lt;br/&gt;
Need to remove it.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
